# The root `.gitignore` blocks `daily-log.md` and `summary-latest.md` by name, anywhere
# in the repo, so a real export can never be committed by accident. That rule stands.
#
# These two exceptions are the test fixtures, and only under `test/fixtures/`. They are
# the `ExportKit` golden files — invented data, no real health record — and this server
# has to read them under the names the app actually writes, because a fixture named
# something else would not be testing the thing. Nobody exports into a fixtures folder,
# so the hole is as narrow as the need.
!test/fixtures/*/daily-log.md
!test/fixtures/*/summary-latest.md
